<title>SWEDEN: Sweden sets auction of 11 bln Skr worth of T-bills.</title>
<headline>Sweden sets auction of 11 bln Skr worth of T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Debt Office said on Tuesday it would invite bids from the market for an auction of seven day Treasury bills worth 11 billion crowns.</p>
<p>The auction will take place on May 21, it said and bids are due at 0900 GMT on May 20.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
